   "cite": "《玉篇·彡部》"
  },
  {
   "id": "se",
   "text": "顔气也",
   "source": "KR1j0018",
   "layer": "main",
   "cite": "《說文解字·色部》"
  },
  {
   "id": "xunzi",
   "text": "青取之於藍，而青於藍。",
   "source": "KR3a0002",
   "layer": "main",
   "cite": "《荀子·勸學》"
  },
  {
