   "text": "染青艸也",
   "source": "KR1j0018",
   "layer": "note",
   "cite": "《說文解字·艸部》"
  },
  {
   "id": "sou",
   "text": "茅蒐，茹藘，人血所生，可以染絳。",
   "source": "KR1j0018",
   "layer": "note",
   "cite": "《說文解字·艸部》"
  },
  {
   "id": "tao",
   "text": "此即今染絳茜草也。",
   "source": "KR3e0079",
   "layer": "note",
